WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.868 --> 00:00:02.067
-Welcome, everybody.

00:00:02.067 --> 00:00:03.801
Welcome, welcome, welcome
to "The Tonight Show."

00:00:03.801 --> 00:00:05.934
Thanks for being here.
Thanks for watching.

00:00:05.934 --> 00:00:08.501
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:08.501 --> 00:00:10.501
Well, guys, everyone
was talking about this.

00:00:10.501 --> 00:00:13.300
Last night, at the end
of a White House photo op,

00:00:13.300 --> 00:00:15.634
journalists weren't supposed to
ask any questions.

00:00:15.634 --> 00:00:18.100
But Fox News reporter
Peter Doocy

00:00:18.100 --> 00:00:19.868
asked President Biden
whether inflation

00:00:19.868 --> 00:00:21.267
would hurt him in the midterms,

00:00:21.267 --> 00:00:23.901
and a hot mic picked up
Biden's response.

00:00:23.901 --> 00:00:24.968
Watch this.

00:00:35.100 --> 00:00:37.067
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:00:44.334 --> 00:00:46.334
When your age is almost 80

00:00:46.334 --> 00:00:48.100
and your approval rating's
almost 30,

00:00:48.100 --> 00:00:50.434
you can pretty much say
whatever you want, I think.

00:00:50.434 --> 00:00:51.667
[ Laughter ]

00:00:51.667 --> 00:00:53.534
Hey, listen, if Biden's
next three years

00:00:53.534 --> 00:00:55.701
are going to be grandpa
at Thanksgiving, sign me up.

00:00:55.701 --> 00:00:57.701
I'm in, I'm in.

00:00:57.701 --> 00:00:59.767
You could tell that felt good
for Biden,

00:00:59.767 --> 00:01:01.267
because today he was
fielding questions like,

00:01:01.267 --> 00:01:03.033
"Yeah, the moron in the back."

00:01:03.033 --> 00:01:04.501
[ Laughter ]

00:01:04.501 --> 00:01:06.868
"How about Dopey in the corner,
you got something to say?"

00:01:06.868 --> 00:01:08.667
Thankfully there were
no hard feelings,

00:01:08.667 --> 00:01:10.801
and Biden even called Doocy
to clear the air.

00:01:10.801 --> 00:01:11.934
Listen to this.

00:01:11.934 --> 00:01:13.968
-That led to a phone call
from the president

00:01:13.968 --> 00:01:16.634
within about an hour
of the salty exchange,

00:01:16.634 --> 00:01:20.901
Biden telling Doocy, quote,
"It's nothing personal, pal."

00:01:20.901 --> 00:01:22.868
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:29.767 --> 00:01:31.067
-Then Biden said,

00:01:31.067 --> 00:01:34.234
"I'll say it again real slow
so you can understand.

00:01:34.234 --> 00:01:38.200
It's nothing personal, pal."

00:01:38.200 --> 00:01:40.400
Not sure that excuse
really flies.

00:01:40.400 --> 00:01:43.701
It's sort of up there with,
"Don't take this the wrong way."

00:01:43.701 --> 00:01:46.467
"Don't take this the wrong way,
but you look tired."

00:01:46.467 --> 00:01:48.667
I hate when people tell me
I look tired.

00:01:48.667 --> 00:01:50.100
Can we just take that
out of our vernacular?

00:01:50.100 --> 00:01:52.434
-Yes.
-Why would you say that?

00:01:52.434 --> 00:01:54.334
-Well, also --
-"Hey, you look bad."

00:01:54.334 --> 00:01:56.334
-[ Laughs ]
It's like, "Thank you.

00:01:56.334 --> 00:01:57.667
Yeah, but actually,
I'm not tired.

00:01:57.667 --> 00:02:02.267
I slept great last night.
This is how I look not tired."

00:02:02.267 --> 00:02:04.767
Of course, all the networks
were reporting on the exchange.

00:02:04.767 --> 00:02:07.601
But I saw that
the far-right network OAN

00:02:07.601 --> 00:02:11.033
accidentally added insult
to injury for Peter Doocy.

00:02:11.033 --> 00:02:12.200
Take a look.

00:02:12.200 --> 00:02:14.801
-President Biden,
the United States president,

00:02:14.801 --> 00:02:18.834
calls for Fox News White House
correspondent Peter Douchey.

00:02:18.834 --> 00:02:21.767
He called him, quote,
"a stupid son of a [bleep]"

00:02:21.767 --> 00:02:23.501
[ Laughter ]

00:02:23.501 --> 00:02:25.200
-Peter Douchey.

00:02:25.200 --> 00:02:27.100
[ Applause ]

00:02:27.100 --> 00:02:28.934
-[ Laughs ]

00:02:28.934 --> 00:02:31.133
-Peter Douchey.

00:02:31.133 --> 00:02:33.467
Biden was like, "Thanks, I'll
have to use that one tomorrow.

00:02:33.467 --> 00:02:34.934
I appreciate it."

00:02:34.934 --> 00:02:37.801
That was like,
"Peter Douchey -- I'm sorry.

00:02:37.801 --> 00:02:39.601
[ Clears throat ]
Penis Douchey.

00:02:39.601 --> 00:02:41.834
I'm s-- I'm sorry.
I can't read this.

00:02:41.834 --> 00:02:43.467
Peter Doocy."

00:02:43.467 --> 00:02:45.467
Peter Doocy actually
heard that anchor

00:02:45.467 --> 00:02:47.334
and was like,
"You stupid some of a --"

00:02:47.334 --> 00:02:49.334
[ Laughter ]

00:02:49.334 --> 00:02:51.634
Meanwhile, Biden is already
dealing with enough

00:02:51.634 --> 00:02:52.968
as tensions continue to rise

00:02:52.968 --> 00:02:54.968
over a Russian invasion
of Ukraine.

00:02:54.968 --> 00:02:56.934
The Department of
Homeland Security has warned

00:02:56.934 --> 00:03:00.801
that Russia could launch
a cyberattack against the U.S.

00:03:00.801 --> 00:03:02.767
Yeah, they're basing this
on evidence

00:03:02.767 --> 00:03:04.834
from every day
for the last 60 years.

00:03:04.834 --> 00:03:06.067
[ Laughter ]

00:03:06.067 --> 00:03:07.767
But the attacks
could be serious.

00:03:07.767 --> 00:03:09.734
Russia could cripple
the electrical grid

00:03:09.734 --> 00:03:11.667
or, worse, turn off TikTok.

00:03:11.667 --> 00:03:13.100
[ Laughter ]

00:03:13.100 --> 00:03:14.501
Americans are like,
"Just in case,

00:03:14.501 --> 00:03:18.968
I'm changing my password
from '1234' to '1234!'"

00:03:18.968 --> 00:03:21.501
[ Laughter ]

00:03:21.501 --> 00:03:22.901
[ Applause ]

00:03:22.901 --> 00:03:24.267
That's right.

00:03:26.334 --> 00:03:28.634
Yeah, an attack
on our electrical grid

00:03:28.634 --> 00:03:30.567
would ground commercial flights.

00:03:30.567 --> 00:03:33.267
So at United, it'll be
pretty much business as usual.

00:03:33.267 --> 00:03:34.501
[ Laughter ]

00:03:34.501 --> 00:03:36.367
And, of course,
former President Trump

00:03:36.367 --> 00:03:39.400
decided to weigh in on
the Ukraine/Russia crisis.

00:03:39.400 --> 00:03:41.667
In a statement, he said
this never would have happened

00:03:41.667 --> 00:03:44.300
under his administration.

00:03:44.300 --> 00:03:46.234
Yeah, 'cause he would have
just called Putin like,

00:03:46.234 --> 00:03:47.434
"Just take it."

00:03:47.434 --> 00:03:50.968
[ Laughter ]

00:03:50.968 --> 00:03:54.067
"What the hell do I care?
Just take it."

00:03:54.067 --> 00:03:55.534
-"Sir."

00:03:55.534 --> 00:03:57.601
-Yeah, "Sir."

00:03:57.601 --> 00:03:58.834
Trump didn't stop there.

00:03:58.834 --> 00:04:00.834
He also claimed that under
his administration,

00:04:00.834 --> 00:04:02.901
the green M&amp;M
would still be sexy.

00:04:02.901 --> 00:04:04.734
[ Laughter ]

00:04:08.868 --> 00:04:10.033
Let's change gears.

00:04:10.033 --> 00:04:12.934
I read that the SAT exam
is going fully digital

00:04:12.934 --> 00:04:15.701
and being shortened
from three hours to two.

00:04:15.701 --> 00:04:19.234
Wow, that's like --
that's like --

00:04:19.234 --> 00:04:20.734
Sorry, I don't have an analogy.

00:04:20.734 --> 00:04:22.534
I bombed on the verbal
on my SATs.

00:04:22.534 --> 00:04:24.100
I'm more of a math guy.

00:04:24.100 --> 00:04:26.100
[ Laughter ]

00:04:27.400 --> 00:04:28.734
Who cares?
I signed my name.

00:04:28.734 --> 00:04:31.133
I got 200 points.

00:04:31.133 --> 00:04:33.434
Eventually the exam
will just be one question --

00:04:33.434 --> 00:04:35.901
"Do you have $200,000
to pay for college?"

00:04:35.901 --> 00:04:38.667
[ Laughter ]
"No."

00:04:38.667 --> 00:04:40.334
"Perfect, come on in."

00:04:40.334 --> 00:04:42.300
[ Applause ]

00:04:44.434 --> 00:04:45.868
Some business news.

00:04:45.868 --> 00:04:49.000
Twitter is reportedly working
on a "close friends" feature

00:04:49.000 --> 00:04:52.901
that would let users share
tweets with up to 150 people.

00:04:52.901 --> 00:04:54.067
That story again --

00:04:54.067 --> 00:04:56.467
Twitter is inventing
the group chat from hell.

00:04:56.467 --> 00:04:58.534
[ Laughter ]

00:04:58.534 --> 00:05:01.267
And, finally,
a puffer fish named Goldie

00:05:01.267 --> 00:05:03.801
had to undergo
emergency dental work

00:05:03.801 --> 00:05:06.400
because her teeth were too big.

00:05:06.400 --> 00:05:09.000
Here she is before and after.
Look at this.

00:05:09.000 --> 00:05:11.133
[ Laughter ]

00:05:13.000 --> 00:05:16.534
The hardest part was putting on
the lead vest for the X-ray.

00:05:16.534 --> 00:05:18.968
When the dentist said, "You may
experience some swelling,"

00:05:18.968 --> 00:05:20.334
the puffer fish was like,

00:05:20.334 --> 00:05:24.667
"Don't take this the wrong way,
but I'm a puffer fish.

00:05:24.667 --> 00:05:26.334
I'm used to it,
you stupid son of a --"

00:05:26.334 --> 00:05:27.667
There you go.
We have a great show.

00:05:27.667 --> 00:05:28.801
Give it up for The Roots,
everybody.

